      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s2.w02.node.direction.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "clearSprites"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s2.w02.node.direction.mimi.opening",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s2.w02.asset.sprite.mimi.tsukkomi",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w02.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w02.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "それも、いつものマダムだ。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w02.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w02.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "平和は、昼までだった。使いの帰り道、稽古場から聞き覚えのある声が流れてきた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w02.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w02.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "役者さんたちの、台本の読み合わせ。表紙に「名場面選集・第一集(再演企画室・監修)」"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s2.w02.node.direction.mimi.shift.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s2.w02.asset.sprite.mimi.serious",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w02.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w02.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "足を止めた、その瞬間だった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w02.node.line.003b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w02.line.003b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "稽古の輪から、よく通る声がひとつ、飛んできた。——「初心者です。監督が」",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w02.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w02.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……私の台詞だ。去年の、大会の朝の。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w02.node.line.004b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w02.line.004b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "耳が、かっと熱くなった。他人の口から聞く自分の言葉は、変な感じがする。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w02.node.line.004c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w02.line.004c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "——それ、誰の許しで着ました?",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w02.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w02.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "受付に戻って、ノノさんと規定を引いた。答えは、あった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w02.node.line.005b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w02.line.005b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "資産条項の枝——「終了した興行の上演権は、会社に帰属する」読み下すと、こうだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w02.node.line.005c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w02.line.005c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "終わった試合も台詞も、**終わった瞬間に会社のもの**になる。",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w02.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w02.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "許可を求める必要すら、無い。だから一言も無く、演目にできる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w02.node.line.006b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w02.line.006b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……役者さんに罪は無い。仕組みの問題だ。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w02.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w02.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "去年、私たちは「選手の所有」という仕組みと戦った。今年の敵は、その続きにいる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w02.node.line.007b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w02.line.007b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "——**思い出の所有**。戦った日々そのものを、資産として持っていかれる仕組みだ。",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w02.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w02.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "手帳に、今年最初の敵の名前を書いた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w02.node.line.008b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w02.line.008b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「上演権(資産条項の枝)」字の横に、鉛筆で小さく、印を付けておく。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w02.node.line.008c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w02.line.008c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "赤線は、壊すと決めてから引くもの。——決めるのは、たぶん、そう遠くない。",
      "emotion": "resolve"
    },
    {
      "type": "effect",
      "id": "main.s2.w02.node.effect.001",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "sharedPoints",
          "amount": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "end",
      "id": "main.s2.w02.node.end.001",
      "mode": "return-to-week"
    }
  ],
